@startuml
title "New Account" creation - Step 4 and 5

actor person
participant "EngagementManagement" as EM
participant "PartyInteractionMgt" as PIM
participant "PartyManagement" as PM
participant "PartyPrivacyMgt" as PPM

== Party Privacy Profile Management ==

activate EM
activate PM

PM -> PM : 50 Identify Process Flow Specification to launch\nand ODA component in charge\nand create taskFlow.id2.6

note over PM, PPM : Alternative Party Mgt directly launches Party Privacy Mgt not possible

PM --> EM : 51 **TMF701** 200 OK\n(sessionId1, party.id1,\nnewProcess(processFlowSpecification=create_new_privacy_profile)\ncallback when privacy profile created (processFlow.id2, taskFlow.id2.6))
deactivate PM

EM -> PPM : 52 **TMF701 Process Flow** POST /processFlow\n(sessionId1, party.id1\nprocessFlowSpecification=create_new_privacy_profile)
activate PPM

PPM -> PPM : 53 **TMF644 Party Privacy Management** POST /partyPrivacyProfile\n(party.id1)\n"default partyPrivacyProfile creation" -> partyPrivacyProfile.id1 initiated
PPM -> PPM : 54 Identify Task Flow Specification to launch\nand create taskFlow.id5.2
PPM --> EM : 55 **TMF701** 201 Created\n(sessionId1, processFlow.id5, taskFlow.id5.2, partyPrivacyProfile.id1\ntask information required: ?approval)

EM -> EM : 56 Display required information
person -> EM : 57 Enter required information

EM -> PPM : 58 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow.id5, taskFlow.id5.2\n(sessionId1, partyPrivacyProfile.id1, partyPrivacyProfileValues, approval)
PPM -> PPM : 59 **TMF644 Party Privacy Management** PATCH /partyPrivacyProfile\n(partyPrivacyProfile.id1, partyPrivacyProfileValues, approval)\n"partyPrivacyProfile update and approval" -> partyPrivacyProfile.id1 validated
PPM --> EM : 60 **TMF701** 200 OK\n(sessionId1, party.id1, partyPrivacyProfile.id1, "privacy profile validated")
deactivate PPM

EM -> PM : 61 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow.id2, taskFlow.id2.6\n(partyPrivacyProfile.id1, "privacy profile created and validated")
activate PM
PM -> PM : 62 Process completed
PM --> EM : 63 **TMF701** 200 OK\n(sessionId1, party.id1, partyRole.id1, digitalIdentity.id1, partyPrivacyProfile.id1,\n"initialized party fully created")
deactivate PM

EM -> PIM : 64 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow.id1, taskFlow.id1.3\n(sessionId1, party.id1, partyRole.id1, digitalIdentity.id1, partyPrivacyProfile.id1,\n"initialized party fully created")
activate PIM
PIM -> PIM : 65 **TMF683 Party Interaction** PATCH /partyInteraction/id1\n(interactionItem.id, party.id1, partyRole.id1, digitalIdentity.id1,\npartyPrivacyProfile.id1, Create your Account done)
PIM -> PIM : 66 Identify available actions
PIM --> EM : 67 **TMF701** 200 OK\ncallback when action choosen (processFlow.id1, taskFlow.id1.5)\navailable actions: Disconnect, Start Order, Browse B2C Catalogue, Read News
deactivate PIM

EM -> EM : 68 Display available actions
deactivate EM

@enduml
